\s1 The Burden against Nineveh
\r (\ref Jonah 1:1–3|JON 1:1-3\ref*)
\p \v 1 \rb This is the burden|מַשָּׂ֖א\rb* \rb against Nineveh|נִֽינְוֵ֑ה\rb*, \rb the book|סֵ֧פֶר\rb* \rb of the vision|חֲז֛וֹן\rb* \rb of Nahum|נַח֖וּם\rb* \rb the Elkoshite|הָאֶלְקֹשִֽׁי׃\rb*:
