\b 
\q1 \v 7 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb is good|ט֣וֹב\rb*,
\q2 \rb a stronghold|לְמָע֖וֹז\rb* \rb in the day|בְּי֣וֹם\rb* \rb of distress|צָרָ֑ה\rb*;
\q2 \rb He cares for|וְיֹדֵ֖עַ\rb* \rb those who trust|חֹ֥סֵי\rb* \rb in Him|בֽוֹ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 8 \rb But with an overwhelming|עֹבֵ֔ר\rb* \rb flood|וּבְשֶׁ֣טֶף\rb*
\q2 \rb He will make|יַעֲשֶׂ֣ה\rb* \rb an end|כָּלָ֖ה\rb* \rb of Nineveh|מְקוֹמָ֑הּ\rb*\f + \fr 1:8 \ft Literally \fqa of her place\f*
\q2 \rb and pursue|יְרַדֶּף־\rb* \rb His enemies|וְאֹיְבָ֖יו\rb* \rb into darkness|חֹֽשֶׁךְ׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Whatever|מַה־\rb* \rb you plot|תְּחַשְּׁבוּן֙\rb* \rb against|אֶל־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb*,
\q2 \rb He|ה֣וּא\rb* \rb will bring|עֹשֶׂ֑ה\rb* \rb to an end|כָּלָ֖ה\rb*.
