\q2 \rb and consumed|אֻ֨כְּל֔וּ\rb* \rb like the drink|וּכְסָבְאָ֖ם\rb* \rb of a drunkard|סְבוּאִ֑ים\rb* —
\q2 \rb like stubble|כְּקַ֥שׁ\rb* \rb that is fully|מָלֵֽא׃\rb* \rb dry|יָבֵ֖שׁ\rb*.
\q1 \v 11 \rb From you, O Nineveh|מִמֵּ֣ךְ\rb*, \rb comes forth|יָצָ֔א\rb*
\q2 \rb a plotter|חֹשֵׁ֥ב\rb* \rb of evil|רָעָ֑ה\rb* \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֖ה\rb*,
\q2 \rb a counselor|יֹעֵ֖ץ\rb* \rb of wickedness|בְּלִיָּֽעַל׃ס\rb*.
\p \v 12 \rb This is what|כֹּ֣ה׀\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb says|אָמַ֣ר\rb*:
\b 
\q1 “\rb Though|אִם־\rb* \rb they are allied|שְׁלֵמִים֙\rb*\rb |וְכֵ֣ן\rb* \rb and numerous|רַבִּ֔ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb yet|וְכֵ֥ן\rb* \rb they will be cut down|נָגֹ֖זּוּ\rb* \rb and pass away|וְעָבָ֑ר\rb*.
\q1 \rb Though I have afflicted you, O Judah|וְעִ֨נִּתִ֔ךְ\rb*,
\q2 \rb I will afflict|אֲעַנֵּ֖ךְ\rb* \rb you no|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb longer|עֽוֹד׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 13 \rb For I will now|וְעַתָּ֕ה\rb* \rb break|אֶשְׁבֹּ֥ר\rb* \rb their yoke|מֹטֵ֖הוּ\rb* \rb from your neck|מֵֽעָלָ֑יִךְ\rb*
\q2 \rb and tear away|אֲנַתֵּֽק׃\rb* \rb your shackles|וּמוֹסְרֹתַ֖יִךְ\rb*.”
\q1 
\p \v 14 \rb The LORD|יְהוָ֔ה\rb* \rb has issued a command|וְצִוָּ֤ה\rb* \rb concerning you, O Nineveh|עָלֶ֙יךָ֙\rb*:
\b 
\q1 “\rb There will be no|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb descendants|יִזָּרַ֥ע\rb*
