\q1 \rb I will cut off|אַכְרִ֨ית\rb* \rb the carved image|פֶּ֧סֶל\rb* \rb and cast idol|וּמַסֵּכָ֛ה\rb*
\q2 \rb from the house|מִבֵּ֨ית\rb* \rb of your gods|אֱלֹהֶ֜יךָ\rb*;
\q1 \rb I will prepare|אָשִׂ֥ים\rb* \rb your grave|קִבְרֶ֖ךָ\rb*,
