\b 
\q1 \v 15 \rb Look|הִנֵּ֨ה\rb* \rb to|עַל־\rb* \rb the mountains|הֶהָרִ֜ים\rb*—
\q2 \rb the feet|רַגְלֵ֤י\rb* \rb of one who brings good news|מְבַשֵּׂר֙\rb*,
\q2 \rb who proclaims|מַשְׁמִ֣יעַ\rb* \rb peace|שָׁל֔וֹם\rb*!
\q1 \rb Celebrate|חָגִּ֧י\rb* \rb your feasts|חַגַּ֖יִךְ\rb*, \rb O Judah|יְהוּדָ֛ה\rb*;
