\c 2
\s1 The Overthrow of Nineveh
\q1 \v 1 \rb One who scatters|מֵפִ֛יץ\rb* \rb advances|עָלָ֥ה\rb*
\q2 \rb against|עַל־\rb* \rb you, O Nineveh|פָּנַ֖יִךְ\rb*.
