\b 
\q1 \v 2 \rb For|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָה֙\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb will restore|שָׁ֤ב\rb* \rb the splendor|גְּא֣וֹן\rb* \rb of Jacob|יַעֲקֹ֔ב\rb*
\q2 \rb like the splendor|כִּגְא֖וֹן\rb* \rb of Israel|יִשְׂרָאֵ֑ל\rb*,
\q1 \rb though|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb destroyers|בֹּֽקְקִ֔ים\rb* \rb have laid them waste|בְקָקוּם֙\rb*
\q2 \rb and ruined|שִׁחֵֽתוּ׃\rb* \rb the branches of their vine|וּזְמֹרֵיהֶ֖ם\rb*.
